WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:13.450
Scallops, scallops, scallops!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:13.450
Shrimp, shrimp, shrimp!

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.530
The Director's taken up the brush!

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.370
Who is the victor?

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.830
Which one is it?!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.590
The victor is Candidate Kurokiba Ryou!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.550
For Tadokoro's dish, the director didn't...

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:34.930
Yeah, he didn't go bare-chested.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.050
Honored guests,

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:40.100
this completes today's program.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.610
The third and fourth matches 
will be held tomorrow.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.110
Have a safe trip home.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.160
Let's go get Tadokoro.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.260
Good idea.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.240
Huh?

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.200
Yuuki?

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.750
Megumi!

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.160
Huh?

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:57.540
Kurokiba-kun was really scary.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.770
Yeah, I totally get it!

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:03.650
You were like a rabbit 
being hunted by a wild dog!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.470
Well done, Tadokoro Megumi.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:09.760
Houjou-san.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.400
It was amazing!

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.220
I didn't think you'd get 
that far against him!

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.270
Great match!

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.890
It wasn't just a fluke 
that you passed the prelims, huh?

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.190
Oh, um...

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:26.190
Good work today, judges.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.970
Your cars are waiting for you.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:28.990
That way, please.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:32.840
Grandfather?

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:33.990
Is something wrong?

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.560
No. It's nothing.

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:36.910
I need to go to the washroom.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:39.870
Hm...

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.620
Tadokoro Megumi, was it?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:49.320
It seems the girl possesses even greater power
 that still lies dormant within her.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:53.050
I went "bare" before I even realized it.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:58.010
The 92nd class is indeed 
a generation of prodigies.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:03:27.980
{OP}

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:22.660
Far beyond the image I have in my mind

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:29.130
The reality I'm building up is still far away

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.880
An endless journey

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:37.890
Let's hone each other's pride

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.390
Words aren't really important

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:42.890
So let's just say "yes" and leave it at that

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:49.860
We fight each other and hone our skills

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.740
Our encounters cause shockwaves

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.490
We're reckless challengers

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:02.490
Heading toward a world as yet unexplored

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.040
A swordsman should use his blade

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.870
To open the way to the future

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:13.590
This is my story and no one else's

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.880
Hayama-kun!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.660
What are you doing out here?

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.320
Nothing much.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.950
I just wanted to feel the night breeze.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.340
Hey, Hayama-kun,

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.000
don't get too bent on winning this.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:51.960
I'm already so proud of you 
for passing the prelims!

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.090
It's a great stage.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.210
Just try to enjoy it, okay?

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:03.770
A smile like that's only going to make me
 even more determined to win.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.260
I <i>will</i> reach the top, no matter what.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.150
Bro, did you pack everything 
you need into the bag?

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:15.790
Oh, do you have 
the victory charm I gave you?

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:16.610
I do.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.620
This pillow I bought yesterday is supposed to give you a good night's rest.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.420
Let's do some aroma therapy 
to help you relax!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.190
Calm down, Isami.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:29.340
I'm gonna pray that you'll be able to give it all you've got tomorrow.

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:30.880
Don't worry, little brother.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.200
I've been honing my skills

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.130
so that I can face off with Yukihira again in the main tournament.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:37.590
Just watch, Isami.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.550
Our Italian cooking will not be defeated!

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.800
Please watch me, Erina-sama.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:46.180
I will be sure to return to you with a win.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.770
You're a good girl, Hisako.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:49.480
I have high expectations.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:51.230
<i>For Jun...</i>

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.110
<i>For Isami...</i>

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.920
<i>For Erina-sama...</i>

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.570
<i>I have to win!</i>

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:02.910
We're now on the second day of 
the Autumn Selection Main Tournament.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:10.080
This day will determine the final four to proceed to the semi-finals!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:13.540
I wonder what heated 
battles we'll see today?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.500
Souma-kun's late.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:16.650
Oh, c'mon!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.220
He should be seeing this 
to prepare for his next match!

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.210
I couldn't get him to wake up.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.680
Maybe I should've just dragged him here.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.450
He pretty much pulled 
an all-nighter the night before.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:29.940
But I heard he's at least left the dorm,
 so I think he'll make it.

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:40.950
Hey.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.780
We meet again, Yukihira Souma.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.120
Oh, you're the guy from the prelims.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.830
<i>93 points!</i>

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.490
<i>Candidate Yukihira scored 93 points!</i>

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.210
<i>He's now in second place!</i>

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.550
<i>Oh, sorry, transfer student.</i>

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.470
<i>I didn't see you.</i>

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:05.680
There's no need to glare 
like that, Yukihira Souma.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:10.250
I'm just thinkin' we can go to
 the tournament hall together, that's all.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:11.010
Huh?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.560
Yeah, sure, whatever.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.650
Okay, hang on a sec.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.190
<i>This bike reeks of testosterone.</i>

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.110
<i>He pretty much screams "punk."</i>

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.020
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.750
Yeah, no kidding.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.630
I didn't think you'd tie 
the cover down with rope.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:42.970
It's more than justified.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:45.210
I've registered the bike, of course,

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.720
and I've subscribed to a GPS tracking service,

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.970
so even if it gets stolen, 
I'll find it right away.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.640
Is this supposed to 
be intimidating?

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:57.300
"Right down to the last detail." 
That's my creed when it comes to cooking.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.540
And anything else, really.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:00.400
Oh?

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.240
<i>For all his bulk, he seems to have a more delicate touch than I expected.</i>

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.760
I haven't told you my name yet, have I?

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:12.700
I'm Mimasaka Subaru. 
Remember that.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.460
<i>The eighth main tournament contestant.</i>

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.650
That's a really pretty-looking name!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.290
No way!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.350
...done by me, of course.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.880
Wow!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:27.720
The third match is now about to begin!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:34.180
This match's theme involves an enviable dish from America
 that has evolved beyond the realm of fast food!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.940
It's the hamburger!

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:39.150
The canonical hamburger involves sandwiching a cooked hamburger patty between two buns.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.110
Candidates are free to choose
 their own ingredients and buns!

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.570
Now, let's have the candidates come in!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.220
It's already starting!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.370
Yukihira!

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:51.530
O-Okay, I'll go look for him outside.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.760
Hey, relay this message to your mistress.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.570
Of the next generation, I'll be the one 
to claim her seat in the Elite Ten.

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:02.550
I'll take the top spot 
at Tohtsuki from her as well.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.510
You would do well to stop
 that nonsense from here on out.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:09.260
I am the one who will succeed Erina-sama and join the Elite Ten.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:18.650
Candidate Hayama Akira ended the Block A prelims in first place by manipulating numerous spices to his advantage!

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:24.570
His opponent is Candidate Arato Hisako,

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:28.530
who passed the Block B prelims in second place
 after receiving high praise for her medicinal curry!

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:31.240
A match between a master of spices and a master of medicinal plants.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:34.870
Their specialties aren't the same, but they follow a similar theme.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:37.210
It's like a match between leaves or something.

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.960
Let the cooking begin!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.140
That's... a kebab!

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:47.840
Hayama decided to go with döner kebab!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.470
Turkish food, huh?

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.290
Right.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:53.100
"Döner" means to turn, 
and "kebab" means to grill.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.310
By rotating the meat as it's slowly heated,

00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:00.040
its melting fat melds with the spices!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.840
Man, smell that great fat!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.480
It looks super tasty!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.490
What's going on with Miss Secretary?

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.120
What's with that bucket?

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:15.040
It's moving!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.080
Huh? It's a...

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:20.040
It's a suppon!{Chinese soft-shelled turtle}

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.610
So Miss Secretary's going to make...

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:23.290
...a suppon burger?!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.170
Suppon preparation involves
 a four-part butchering technique.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:31.440
You flip the suppon on its back, and then, 
when it sticks its neck out, you strike.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.060
She didn't hesitate at all!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.440
She's pouring something on the body after the bloodletting.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.280
Is that sake?

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.070
It prevents the blood from coagulating.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.030
I bet she's going to use the blood
 in her hamburger patties!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.200
Suppon guts are gross!

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.460
Such firm resolve even though 
she's covered in fresh blood.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.830
Hisako-onee-sama, you're so wonderful!

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:09.590
Along with medicinal plant ingredients such as schisandra fruit and kinshinsai,

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.000
I see ginger and Shaoxing wine.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:12.590
Yeah.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:17.600
She intends to make a rich stock by simmering even the shell.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:19.970
Hurry up, Souma-kun!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:22.940
Hayama-kun and Arato-san 
are already cooking!

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:23.980
Sorry, sorry.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.230
And who's this Arato?

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.110
She is Nakiri-san's secretary!

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:29.610
Oh, Miss Secretary.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:33.120
C'mon! Where've you been, anyway?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:36.290
Oh, I ran into a weird guy.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.750
Yukihira Souma.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.530
Family runs a diner.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:44.210
Draws on a rich imagination springing from that experience in his cooking.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.670
Has strong pride in his family diner's name.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:51.630
<i>Cooked char o-kakiage 
and souffle omelet at camp.{the transition to thought is arbitrary, but his lips aren't moving below}</i>

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.160
<i>Height, 171 centimeters. 
Weight, 57 kilograms.</i>

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:58.550
<i>Blood type, B. 
Shoe size, 26.5 centimeters.</i>

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.700
<i>Slept an average of six hours and
 fourteen minutes this past month.</i>

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:05.560
<i>In junior high, he was 
in classes 1-5, 2-2, and 3-7.</i>

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.310
"Down to the last detail"...

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.110
<i>Takumi Aldini...</i>

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.250
<i>Heir to a trattoria in Toscana.</i>

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.690
<i>Father is Japanese. 
His mother is Italian.</i>

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.370
<i>Height, 168 centimeters. 
Weight, 54 kilograms.</i>

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.590
<i>Blood type, A.</i>

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:22.070
<i>Sees Yukihira Souma as his arch-rival.</i>

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:24.040
<i>Lives alone with his younger brother, Isami.</i>

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.710
<i>Calls home twice a month.</i>

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.930
<i>Has a fan club in Tohtsuki Academy.</i>

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.160
<i>Has a fear of heights.</i>

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.950
<i>Interested in Japanese food samples.</i>

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.420
<i>Sets two alarms before going to sleep.</i>

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.550
<i>Has a mole on his left shoulder.</i>

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:34.770
<i>Prefers showers to baths.</i>

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:35.700
<i>Bad at card games.</i>

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.010
<i>Underwear tends to have a checked pattern.</i>

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:41.870
<i>And what he values most is...</i>

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.260
U-Um, since our current location is here...

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:50.270
I'm so sorry, Souma-kun! It's my fault!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:50.940
No prob.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.230
What? Did you get lost?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.100
Huh?

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.730
Just watch in my standby room, then.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.900
It's right there.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:01.490
Yukihira?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.990
Tadokoro-san too?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.700
Why do I have to be here as well?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.490
Well, why not?

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.580
Aren't you done checking your ingredients?

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.420
Choose any sweet you want with your tea.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.380
Oh, you don't need to play the host!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.960
What are your thoughts on this fight, Yukihira?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.880
Oh, I don't know.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:25.340
I've never seen Miss Secretary's cooking.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.100
What do you think, Tadokoro?

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.930
Um... Arato-san specializes in
 cooking with medicinal plants.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.190
I'm not sure they'd pair well with hamburgers.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:40.150
It looks like Arato Hisako will finish first.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:45.570
She's kneading chopped suppon meat and innards with ground pork.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:49.160
She seasoned the meat with salt and pepper.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.500
She used pork caul, the mesh of fat 
enveloping pork organs,

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.750
to wrap the patty and keep it from disintegrating while it grills.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.090
<i>Hisako!</i>

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.380
<i>Look, Hisako!</i>

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.880
<i>The cherry blossoms are so beautiful!</i>

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.350
<i>She who possesses the God Tongue.</i>

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:12.100
<i>My wish is to serve at her side.</i>

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:16.100
<i>To walk close to her, 
following a few steps behind.</i>

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.440
<i>To make that wish come true,</i>

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.360
<i>I will survive this match and win!</i>

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:28.030
I present to you a dish that will shake your instincts to the very core!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.950
It is the Suppon Burger!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:34.910
Now then, what will be the judges' reactions?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:41.340
<i>The faint sweetness and pronounced elasticity that steamed buns are known for!</i>

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.880
<i>All the downy hairs on my body
 are standing on end!</i>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.470
I feel like my body...

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.640
...is burning up!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.770
Whoa!

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:55.100
Look at their glow, despite their age!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.770
Is that the power of suppon?

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.650
A meltingly tender, meaty hamburger patty.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.610
It's overflowing with the suppon's umami!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:07.780
The sauce is thickened suppon stock.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.620
It coats the hamburger patty and creates a rich flavor!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:16.250
The fresh blood I added to the hamburger patty warms you up from the inside.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.500
I also mixed dobekkou powder
 into the hamburger patty.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.250
Dobekkou is dried suppon shell.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.920
In traditional Chinese medicine,
 it is used to improve vigor.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.340
So both the sauce and the hamburger patty contain suppon.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.510
No wonder the judges look so satisfied.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:32.720
Nay!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:37.350
The truth of this dish can only be understood by those who have tasted it.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:42.110
The answer lies in the viscosity of the gelatin from the suppon.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.980
You are exactly right.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:48.070
Viscosity has a great impact
 on a dish's perceived richness.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:53.660
And this hamburger patty contains a lot of gelatin that has seeped into the stock.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:15:01.290
Of all the parts of the body, the soft palate—the inner part of the upper jaw—is most sensitive to physical stimuli.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.260
The viscous hamburger patty and sauce are providing a sensuous stimulus.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.220
In other words, this dish not only speaks to one's sense of taste,

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.010
but also to one's sense of touch.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:16.430
<i>It's as though the suppon's seductive greatness is bearing down upon me!</i>

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.280
Roar!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.740
Its deliciousness... is monstrous!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.240
I was in rapture without intending to.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.830
W-Wow!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.580
I'm so amazed she was able to leverage medicinal herbs to this degree!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.000
Yeah.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:47.500
If I ever face her, the depth and scope of her knowledge will pose quite a threat.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.470
But the victor of this 
match will be Hayama Akira.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.050
Huh?

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.730
What's going on?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:08.280
The audience's mood shifted the moment
 Hayama began cooking his hamburger patties!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.780
It's not just about what happens in the mouth.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.120
That's not all there is to the world of taste.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.420
It's done.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:26.040
We'll now sample Candidate Hayama Akira's hamburger!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:30.550
The overpowering scent of meat
 is flooding the arena!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.550
Wow! Amazing!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.550
There's piping hot kebab meat on top of the thick hamburger patty!

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.510
Now, quickly!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.560
All the judges have turned into ravenous dogs!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.520
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.270
<i>What's your play, Hayama Akira?!</i>

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.730
<i>That dish cannot possibly avoid
 being heavy and overbearing.</i>

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:51.150
<i>No matter how he may try
 to lure people in with fragrance,</i>

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.570
<i>if the actual flavors are crude...</i>

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.330
I couldn't stop myself!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.830
I've already finished mine!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.660
<i>What?</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.500
You chose to use pita bread
 as the hamburger bun, I see.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.040
<i>Pita bread.</i>

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.210
<i>It's a Middle Eastern bread which is baked at high temperatures,</i>

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.670
<i>resulting in a hollow "pocket"
 that is then stuffed with ingredients.</i>

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:17.800
<i>Homemade yogurt sauce was used to remove the gamey flavor of the kebab</i>

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.260
<i>and to enhance the flavor of the spices.</i>

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:24.520
<i>The hamburger patty itself is köfte,</i>

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:29.980
<i>a Turkish "burger" made from a combination of lamb and beef with plenty of spices.</i>

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.150
<i>It's very pungent!</i>

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.530
<i>What is going on?</i>

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.150
<i>How can such a heavy hamburger patty be...</i>

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.740
Allow me to teach you.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.490
There are four components a hamburger must have.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.950
Buns, hamburger patty, sauce, and pickles.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:49.710
The pickles' pungent smell and acidity are what enhances the meat's umami.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.420
Pickles are the hidden star ingredient.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.130
You seem to have substituted finely-julienned ginger for pickles,

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.470
but if you were to ask me,

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.640
I'd say that was a weak move.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.550
What?

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.640
Then what did you do?

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:04.430
What I chose to act as pickles is achaar!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:11.690
Achaar: a preserved condiment with strong acidity
 made by brining vegetables and fruit in mustard oil.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.820
This achaar was made with onions.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:19.200
The mustard oil's pungent odor enhances the hamburger patty's umami.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:25.080
The acidity is provided primarily by amchoor,
 a spice made from dried, unripened mangoes.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.250
I also used lemon juice for added acidity.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.880
For fragrance, garlic,

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:35.210
chili pepper, clove, cumin seed,
 black pepper, and paprika powder.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:38.260
I used honey for sweetness.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.720
There's some ginger, as well.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:45.850
<i>He used his rare sense of smell to build
 the pickles' fragrance with a delicate touch.</i>

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:51.360
<i>He flipped the heavy fat and gamey lamb flavors into something you can't get enough of!</i>

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:55.900
<i>He made the human instinct for food explode!</i>

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.650
<i>His talent is not limited to curries and spices alone.</i>

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:04.370
<i>Hayama Akira, you have the potential to reach the God Tongue!</i>

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.460
The winner of this match is clear!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.830
What I aim to achieve is the number one spot.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:14.040
Someone who's desperate 
to stay number two

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.250
can never hope to win against me.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.210
What?!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:23.430
Everything about you, from your goals
 to your cooking... is too small.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.890
<i>I don't want to admit it,</i>

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.850
<i>but when I smelled his cooking...</i>

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:32.810
<i>my hidden hunger was forcibly exposed!</i>

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:39.240
The third match's victor is Hayama Akira!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.950
<i>I... lost.</i>

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.080
Hisako...

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.040
I am sorry.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.420
Excuse me.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.380
It's almost time for the fourth match.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.430
Those who are not candidates will need
 to go back to the seating for the audience.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.430
Oh, right.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.850
I'm sorry, Eizan-senpai!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.270
Yukihira.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.690
I swear I'll settle the score

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.190
from our match on the first day of camp during the Autumn Selection!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.490
You're talking about the match that Inui-senpai brilliantly declared a draw, right?

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.740
That brings back memories!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.580
I-In any case, I'll beat you for sure!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:30.040
<i>Eventually, I'll challenge you to a Cooking Battle.</i>

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.330
<i>And that's when I will crush you!</i>

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.630
<i>There's someone my age who's this good.</i>

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.590
<i>If I'd stayed holed up in Yukihira,
 I'd never have known about him.</i>

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.720
You're right, Takumi.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.930
So don't lose, no matter what, okay?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.810
Let's see once and for all 
who's gonna do the crushing, yeah?

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.140
Yeah!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:51.890
Sure!

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.730
Of course, Yukihira!

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:01.400
Still, I'm surprised Mimasaka-kun could say with such conviction

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.110
that Hayama-kun would win, 
even after seeing Arato-san's amazing dish.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.700
He's exceptionally talented.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:11.790
For Mimasaka Subaru, 
Tohtsuki is a perfect playground.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.250
Hey.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.000
Hands off my tools.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:21.510
I know you've been sniffing around
 for the last few days about me.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.510
Tell me what that's all about.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:27.800
Do you really like these worn-out tools that much?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:31.060
I bet you can only make crap using them.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:33.100
Is that meant to provoke me?

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.060
I see right through you.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.310
There's something I wanted to ask you.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.060
It's about your little brother.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.980
His cooking instincts have always been rather lacking since he was little.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.530
It's clear that he's a second-rate chef.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:49.030
Trailing his older brother is 
about the best he can manage.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.750
What's it like to have an incompetent brother?

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:55.660
You bastard!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.960
Hey, Italian,

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:01.630
we're going to be facing 
off <i>mano a mano</i>, after all.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:04.590
We should try to enjoy it the best we can,

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:10.010
Takumi Aldini.

00:22:10.010 --> 00:23:39.980
{ED}

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:39.080
An intensely burning desire was born

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:44.920
But not in me, in someone else

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:49.720
Where's the me who believed that

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:49.720
yume to kibou hoka ni nani ga iru to

