00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:54.850
All one needs is to have hopes and dreams

00:22:54.850 --> 00:23:00.100
Wrapped around something long, my compass was lost

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:05.860
On the border of life and death, snow drops bloom

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:11.200
If by some mistake they get smashed

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:16.370
At least put flowers on the empty husk

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:22.040
Is that the way things are? Yes, it is

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:27.090
You can call it resignation if you want

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:33.010
But that's not me, that's not me

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:37.640
There's no value in something just anyone could make

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:42.270
Urara-chan...

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.270
we have an emergency!

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:46.360
What's the matter, Yua-chan?

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:47.780
I just got a message, and...

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:53.780
We... We have an announcement 
for our honored guests.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:59.000
The next match between Candidate Mimasaka Subaru and Candidate Takumi Aldini...

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.620
will be a Cooking Battle!

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.000
A Cooking Battle?

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:11.010
Next episode: The Pursuer.
